# LeakSanitizer suppressions for scripts/asan_run.py (plans/MASTER_PLAN.md item R1).
#
# Only leaks PROVEN to be inside a third-party library, never in Scarab's or sunlight's own code,
# may be listed here - one entry per leak, each with the reason it is not ours to fix. A leak in
# Scarab is fixed; one in sunlight is reported to sunlight.
